content.text:
Now CSS for harvest HUD. Add after `.pause-btn` or wave banner area. Position top center below score. `pointer-events:none`. Use `--harvest-accent` maybe weapon accent automatically via var. We can set inline CSS from main `--weapon-accent` already global. Use `var(--weapon-accent)`. HUD initial weapon accent.

CSS:
```
.harvest-hud {
 position:absolute;
 top: calc(91px + var(--safe-top));
 left:50%;
 transform: translateX(-50%);
 width:min(430px, 46vw);
 padding: 11px 15px 12px;
 background: linear-gradient(...);
 border:1px solid rgba(var(--weapon-accent-rgb), .26);
 border-top: 2px solid var(--weapon-accent);
 clip-path: polygon(...);
 backdrop-filter: blur(9px);
 transition: opacity .25s, transform .25s;
}
.harvest-hud.is-hidden { display:none!important; } (already universal)
.harvest-hud.complete { animation: harvest-complete ...}
...
```
Need pulse-dot class existing? There is `.pulse-dot` used in tilt-badge. Let's check.

